---
interface Props { kind: 'structure' | 'sequence' }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
---
<figure>
{kind === 'structure' ? <svg viewBox="0 0 700 400" role="img" aria-labelledby="builder-structure-title builder-structure-desc">
<title id="builder-structure-title">Builder class relationships</title><desc id="builder-structure-desc">ReportDirector calls construction steps on the abstract ReportBuilder. TextReportBuilder and HtmlReportBuilder inherit those steps and implement build, producing text and HTML strings.</desc>
<defs><marker id="builder-inherit" viewBox="0 0 12 12" refX="11" refY="6" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" orient="auto"><path d="M1 1 L11 6 L1 11 Z" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="currentColor"/></marker><marker id="builder-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></marker></defs>
<g class="edges"><path d="M205 70 H325" marker-end="url(#builder-arrow)"/><path d="M175 235 V170 H420 V130" marker-end="url(#builder-inherit)"/><path d="M540 235 V170 H475 V130" marker-end="url(#builder-inherit)"/><path d="M175 290 V335" marker-end="url(#builder-arrow)"/><path d="M540 290 V335" marker-end="url(#builder-arrow)"/></g>
<g class="nodes"><rect x="15" y="40" width="190" height="60"/><rect x="325" y="15" width="270" height="115"/><rect x="45" y="235" width="260" height="55"/><rect x="410" y="235" width="260" height="55"/><rect x="60" y="335" width="230" height="50"/><rect x="425" y="335" width="230" height="50"/></g>
<g class="labels"><text x="110" y="75">ReportDirector</text><text x="460" y="40">«abstract» ReportBuilder</text><text x="460" y="65">title(String)</text><text x="460" y="87">tools(List&lt;String&gt;)</text><text x="460" y="111">build(): String</text><text x="175" y="268">TextReportBuilder</text><text x="540" y="268">HtmlReportBuilder</text><text x="175" y="365">Plain-text String</text><text x="540" y="365">HTML-fragment String</text><text x="265" y="56" class="annotation">uses</text><text x="350" y="205" class="annotation">Hollow triangle: extends</text><text x="215" y="317" class="annotation">builds</text><text x="580" y="317" class="annotation">builds</text></g>
</svg> : <svg viewBox="0 0 700 440" role="img" aria-labelledby="builder-sequence-title builder-sequence-desc">
<title id="builder-sequence-title">Building a report with a director</title><desc id="builder-sequence-desc">The client supplies a builder to ReportDirector. The director sets title and tools, then returns. The client calls build on the builder and receives the finished string.</desc>
<defs><marker id="builder-seq-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/></marker></defs>
<g class="nodes"><rect x="15" y="10" width="150" height="45"/><rect x="240" y="10" width="180" height="45"/><rect x="510" y="10" width="175" height="45"/></g>
<g class="edges" stroke-dasharray="4 5"><path d="M90 55 V425"/><path d="M330 55 V425"/><path d="M597 55 V425"/></g>
<g class="edges" marker-end="url(#builder-seq-arrow)"><path d="M90 115 H330"/><path d="M330 180 H597"/><path d="M330 245 H597"/><path d="M330 290 H90" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/><path d="M90 345 H597"/><path d="M597 405 H90" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/></g>
<g class="labels"><text x="90" y="38">Client / main</text><text x="330" y="38">ReportDirector</text><text x="597" y="38">Concrete builder</text><text x="210" y="95">constructEngineeringReport(builder)</text><text x="460" y="160">title("Engineering Tools")</text><text x="460" y="225">tools(toolList)</text><text x="210" y="275">recipe complete</text><text x="350" y="330">build()</text><text x="350" y="390">finished String</text></g>
</svg>}
<figcaption>{kind === 'structure' ? 'The director controls the recipe; each concrete builder controls the resulting representation.' : 'Construction and product retrieval are separate. Dashed arrows indicate returns; fluent setter returns are omitted.'}</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>figure{margin:28px 0;overflow-x:auto}svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;min-width:560px;padding:10px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--muted);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}.edges{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5}.nodes rect{fill:var(--soft);stroke:var(--line);rx:5}.labels{text-anchor:middle;fill:var(--ink);font:13px system-ui,sans-serif}.annotation{fill:var(--muted);font-size:12px}figcaption{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:9px}@media print{svg{min-width:0}}</style>
